# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — introspect coros JSON shape.
#
# Spec §10: 9 introspection ops; coros lists active strands.
# Exit-criterion 8: ops return non-empty JSON for an idle VM.  The
# dispatcher emits the introspect JSON as the value field directly (not
# JSON-string-wrapped like the eval result path) — so the "coros" key
# appears verbatim as a substring of the response line.
#
# Note: introspect emits ONLY a result envelope, no done envelope (the
# done is reserved for eval-frame end-of-output marking, per spec §6).

> {"id":3,"op":"introspect","what":"coros"}
< "id":3 | "kind":"result" | "coros"
